   "user": "seon",
   "message": "it features a lot of topics but importantly I think truth should be split up into:\n \n- observation/frame ( I keep seeing this person starve with the food they get for lunch)\n\n- Perceived problem (kids dont get enough lunch food/ no child should starve etc)\n\n- cause (capitalism/prinicpals waste too much money, they arent aware, etc)\n\n- solution (hire more etc)\n\n- effect ( kids go to school less)\n\nWhich, the effect, can loop back into a new observation.",
   "timestamp": "2026-09-10T21:42:46.073000+00:00",
   "channel": "general",
   "channel_id": "discord:1344300408893345866",
